ohru Sasaki, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at J.P. Morgan Chase Bank of Tokyo.  \par \par \uc2 In any case, the MOF is expected to examine various factors, such as overseas and domestic economic developments, as well as corporate earnings and stock price movements, in deciding when to take action, if any, analysts say.  \par \par \uc2 -By Leika Kihara, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; leika.kihara@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Kirsty Mackenzie [ 26-10-04 0651GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020041026e0aq000as\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
