\par\par \b \uc2 DJ  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF: Didn't  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Market In September  \b0\par\par\uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 September 2004\par 13:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2004, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  \par \par \uc2 September 30, 2004 06:00 ET (10:00 GMT)  \par \par \uc2 DJ \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  MOF: Didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  In \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Market In September  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  stayed out of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the sixth straight month in September, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 MOF said it conducted no yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the period between Aug. 28 and Sept. 28, reflecting stability in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates during the month as the dollar hovered around Y110.  \par \par \uc2 The figure confirmed comments Thursday morning by Japanese Chief Cabinet Secretary Hiroyuki Hosoda that Tokyo hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market in more than six months.  \par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, some traders cited unsubstantiated rumors in the market that the Bank of Japan, which acts under orders from MOF, sold yen for dollars Monday night - possibly to help alleviate the impact of higher crude oil prices on Japan's economy.  \par \par \uc2 But the data showed Japan has stayed out of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since April, following the dollar's recovery against the yen after hitting a four-year low in March.  \par \par \uc2 During the three months from January to March, Japan sold more than Y15 trillion as it tried to prevent a rapid appreciation of the yen from hurting the nation's economic recovery.  \par \par \uc2 Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  data covers settlement dates during September. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trades are settled after two business days.  \par \par \uc2 Web site:  {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.mof.go.jp/english/e1c021.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.mof.go.jp/english/e1c021.htm}}}\par \par \uc2 -By Michiyo Seki, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; michiyo.seki@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Kirsty Mackenzie  \par \par \uc2 -0-   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020040930e09u006sh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
