\par\par \b \uc2 Japan July Foreign Reserves $819.2B; Up $1.25B On Month  \b0\par\par\uc2 218 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 August 2004\par 02:57\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2004, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Japan's foreign reserves edged up $1.25 billion to $819.2 billion in July from a month earlier, the government said Friday, while separate data confirmed Tokyo stayed out of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in the April-June quarter, ending its unprecedented market-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  spree.  \par \par \uc2 July's rise in reserves of convertible foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , gold and International Monetary Fund special drawing rights follows modest gains of $1.10 billion in June and $1.88 billion in May. Reserves dropped $11.61 billion in April, breaking a seven-month surge to record highs.  \par \par \uc2 In the first three months of the year, reserves skyrocketed more than $150 billion as the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  ordered massive dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the yen's rise and protect \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's export-driven economic rebound.  \par \par \uc2 While the government has never explained the abrupt end to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in March, it says it remains committed to ensuring stable \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. Analysts say the combination of an increasingly robust economy and pressure from the U.S. and other trading partners likely prompted the change of course.  \par \par \uc2 Ministry data showed no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  took place in the three months through June, compared with sales of Y14.83 trillion in the previous period.  \par \par \uc2 -0-   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020040806e086000um\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
