\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  did not  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market in July.   \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 2004\par 12:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, July 30 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday it did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in July, staying out of the market for a fourth consecutive after spending a record amount last year to stem the yen's rise.   \par \par \uc2 The MOF has stayed away from the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since March, after selling 20 trillion yen ($178 billion) last year and another 14.8 trillion yen in the first three months of this year to keep the yen's gains in check.   \par \par \uc2 Since then, the yen has traded in a range spanning from a four-year high of 103.40 yen per dollar at the end of March to nearly 115 yen per dollar in mid-May.   \par \par \uc2 It was trading around 111.45 yen per dollar late on Friday, down about two percent in the past month, as the dollar gained on optimism on the U.S. economy.   \par \par \uc2 Most analysts say the MOF seems comfortable with \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels at the moment, and that its return to the market would require sudden \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swings.   \par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Sadakazu Tanigaki said on Friday that the current \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is reflecting economic fundamentals.   \par \par \uc2 When Tokyo was waging aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  until March, Japanese officials repeatedly said they needed to act because the yen's strength was out of sync with economic fundamentals. ($1=112.09 Yen).    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040730e07u00187\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
